  "prefLabel": "Jus 2001.14 Forensic pathology",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 2001.14 “Forensic pathology” means the branch of medicine concerned with the scientific study of the nature of disease or injury and its cause, processes, development, and consequences in the context of medicolegal cases.\n\nSource. #8937, eff 7-14-07",
